    "body": "I mean, it has to be bound to some realm. And we generally want to pick the relevant realm of this, for methods. (For constructors the \"relevant realm of this\" is not super well-defined, since the this object is still being created, and is derived from the realm of new.target, which is usually-but-not-with-Reflect.construct the current realm.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
