    "body": "Chrome and Firefox's behavior is the desired one. This is a clear-cut instance of https://github.com/heycam/webidl/issues/135 (triggered by \"let p be a new promise\").\r\n\r\nMore information on why at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#realms-settings-objects-global-objects, starting with \"In general, web platform specifications should use...\"",
